* @title Scanner behavior modes
* @attribution Griswold 1971, Chapter 2
* @match substring
* @expect >>>
* ANCHORED FAILED
* UNANCHORED SUCCEEDED
* <<<
          S = 'XYZ'
          &ANCHOR = 1
          S 'Y' :S(BAD1)F(OK1)
OK1       OUTPUT = 'ANCHORED FAILED'
          &ANCHOR = 0
          S 'Y' :F(BAD2)S(OK2)
OK2       OUTPUT = 'UNANCHORED SUCCEEDED'
          :(END)
BAD1      OUTPUT = 'BAD1'
BAD2      OUTPUT = 'BAD2'
END